      "text": "City staff report (2020): SummerHill owns the 3.06-acre site at 2343 and 2363 Calle Del Mundo and 5211 Lafayette Street, then APNs 097-05-062, 097-05-063 and 097-05-064, within the Tasman East Specific Plan; architectural approval for 347 rental units including 34 affordable.",
